As I said at October's membership meeting, I'm willing to volunteer as=20
the=C2=A0Mike & Key's Field Day 2027*_/Assistant/_*=C2=A0Director.

Thanks to those who replied to my previous meeting proposal, thank you.=20
The feedback was clear that *Mondays don't work* for some. I've revised=20
the proposal, and based on your feedback, I'm proposing we shift to *1st=20
and 3rd Wednesdays at 8:00 PM*.

*Please provide feedback if 1st and 3rd Wednesdays at 8:00 PM works or=20
does not work for you. *

It would be great if those interested in Field Day 2027 could attend at=20
least one of the two Zoom calls each month. But even if you can only=20
join two or three before Field Day, your help is appreciated. (Slack=20
will be granted for those connecting late after the 7:30 Tech Net closes.)

With Field Day 2027 on the horizon, it's time to get our planning=20
committee together on a regular cadence. These monthly Zoom calls will=20
help us work through the action items coming out of our 2026 debrief:=20
drafting a field day chairperson, site reservations, organizing=20
equipment, setting up volunteer sign-up, developing checklists,=20
scrounging for our wish-list items, etc..

*Proposed meeting dates:*

