We'll try to keep the meetings to *60 minutes or less*. We'll share=20
agendas in advance and post notes afterward to the=20
FieldDay@mkarc.groups.io list so anyone who misses a call can stay in=20
the loop.

Again please reply to let me know if this schedule works for you, or if=20
there's a better recurring time slot.

